title: Front Camera Auto Pop-Up on Proximity Sensor Activation
raw_community_title: ⚡ [Lightning] Front Camera Auto Pop-Up on Proximity Sensor Activation
category: Cameras and ADAS
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2026
trim: All
source_sheet: 2021-2026 F150.xlsx
notes: '[Category: Cameras and ADAS] [Years: 2022-2026] [Original Title: Fix front
  camera not popping up on screen when front sensor activated]

  Forces front camera to pop up on screen when forward sensor is triggered. Applicable
  to trucks without Park Assist and BlueCruise.'
steps:
- module: IPMA
  address: 706-16-01
  targets:
  - mask: xxx* xxxx xx--
    offset_hint: '+8'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 1
      feature: VehicleCfg_APAInterface (VCAPAI)
recipe_version: '1.1'
